# class, put on the instruction or the data bus by cfg.is_data, so the single site gives both agents the
# window; the red fires on both buses, which is the evidence for that sentence rather than the code reading.
# IT APPLIES AND IT PRODUCES THE DIGEST THE LANDING-58 BUILDS RECORDED. git apply --check passes on a clean
# archive of c736d29 and on a clean archive of 4bd933f (the blob is unchanged between them), and applying it
